cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EvoPersonality_ABM: an agent-based model of coupling-strength (K) personality evolution"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code and analysis scripts for an agent-based model that adds a
  two-component coupling strength (K_self, K_out) as an evolving trait on top
  of Lindgren's (1991) memory-evolution model, examined through the Markov
  structure (move-transition network) of the evolved strategies and compared
  against human attachment-style groups.
authors:
  - family-names: Annen
    given-names: Yasumasa
    affiliation: Sapporo University of Health Sciences
repository-code: "https://github.com/dpforest610/EvoPersonality_ABM"
license: MIT
